160	     * Removes a line from an invoice; empty if no such invoice or line. Refused when what is left would
161	     * be less than a fixed discount. A sent invoice with no payments goes back to draft; one with a
162	     * payment refuses it.
163	     */
164	    @Transactional
165	    public Optional<Invoice> removeLine(Long invoiceId, Long lineId) {
166	        Optional<Invoice> found = invoices.findWithLinesById(invoiceId);
