184	     * Changes a line of an invoice; empty if no such invoice or line. The line has already been
185	     * checked. Refused when the subtotal would be less than a fixed discount. A sent invoice with no
186	     * payments goes back to draft; one with a payment refuses it.
187	     */
188	    @Transactional
189	    public Optional<Invoice> updateLine(Long invoiceId, Long lineId, String description, BigDecimal qty,
190	            BigDecimal unitPrice, boolean taxExempt, BigDecimal discountPct, BigDecimal taxRate) {
191	        Optional<Invoice> found = invoices.findWithLinesById(invoiceId);
192	        if (found.isEmpty()) {
